{"success":true,"data":{"name":"UDAAN 3.0 2027 (Class 10th)","description":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n  <head>\n     <style>\n       .desc-container {\n         display: flex;\n         flex-direction: column;\n         padding: 16px 13px;\n       }\n       \n       .desc-row {\n         display: flex;\n         align-items: center;\n         margin-bottom: 16px;\n         border-bottom: 1px solid #efefef;\n         padding: 4px 0;\n       }\n       \n       .desc-row-item-title {\n         font-size: 14px;\n         line-height: 22px;\n         margin-right: 6px;\n       }\n\n       .desc-row-item-content {\n         font-size: 14px;\n         line-height: 18px;\n         margin-right: 6px;\n       }\n     </style>\n  </head>\n\n  <body>\n<div class=\"desc-container\">\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">01.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-b0c3e6fe-7fff-d0f3-3b8f-81e6baf0b07d\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">This batch includes comprehensive coverage of all the subjects for CBSE 10th.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">02.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a1f76f99-7fff-e155-43a9-11ea0b15e9ef\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Faculty members will cover Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Mathematics, English,&nbsp; SST, Computer, and Hindi.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">03.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7db99a89-7fff-f104-31d7-fe297317f705\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">5 Days scheduled classes will be held in a week.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">04.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ac13a4b0-7fff-0125-3396-c87641d0c288\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Classes will be Live, per day 2 classes will be held.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">05.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-48937ced-7fff-3f26-1c25-a51bf8835a6e\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Duration of the lectures will be 1 hour 15 mins.</span></span></p>\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-fb86969d-7fff-1756-3530-21434895eb5b\"></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">06.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-6e0b8a56-7fff-5a50-f3e2-9bcc92521669\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">PDF Notes of each Class will be uploaded on PW App</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">07.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2aea1b02-7fff-6cc9-83ee-6f175a78dfeb\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Daily Home Assignments with their Video Solution in Quiz format</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">08.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-022c1db8-7fff-7bb3-c8ae-3c250e68ebec\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Dedicated faculties for solving doubts through best-in-class doubt engine.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">09.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-1dcc9229-7fff-8cfc-ebf3-6464d4164dd4\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Peer-to-Peer doubt solving will be provided.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">10.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a87b2b42-7fff-9b64-2df7-a04678c5c4c7\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Scheduled tests will be held according to the planner.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">11.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-92ff0f3d-7fff-dbed-57cf-06eaafe9cf58\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">The complete course will be accessible to all the students until the June 2027</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">12.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-fa87cc19-7fff-e92a-ffd4-51a43bead681\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Classes starting from - 21st September 2026</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">13.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-754b8b07-7fff-01c3-4fec-960e43de330d\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Complete Syllabus will be covered till Januaray 15th, 2027</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">14.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-753e3e5e-7fff-14ab-9123-74ffe1fa4e28\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Complete Revision of whole syllabus for Final Exam will be concluded by 31st January 2027</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">15.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">For App/Web Navigation the latest Feature Updates &amp; Student Support please subscribe to our Support YouTube channel:<br /><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pwstudentsupport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\">https://www.youtube.com/@pwstudentsupport</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">16.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">The registration fee is included in the price of the batch which is showing on the website. The breakup of registration fee will be mentioned on invoice. You may be provided with access to Notes, PYQ&rsquo;s. Mock Test Papers, AITS Test Series, Previous year batches &amp; other materials, the access can vary depending on the batch you purchase, so that exact details might change from one batch to another.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","shortDescription":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n <head>\n   <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n   <style>\n     .description-meta-container {\n       display: flex !important;\n       flex-direction: column !important;\n       gap: 14px !important;\n     }\n\n     .child-container {\n       display: flex !important;\n       align-items: center !important;\n       gap: 12px !important;\n     }\n\n     .icon {\n       width: 32px !important;\n       height: 32px !important;\n     }\n\n     .sub-text {\n       font-size: 14px !important;\n       font-weight: 500 !important;\n     }\n\n     .main-text {\n       font-size: 14px !important;\n       font-weight: 600 !important;\n     }\n\n     .text {\n       font-size: 14px !important;\n       font-weight: 500 !important;\n     }\n\n     .text-container {\n       display: flex !important;\n       flex-direction: column !important;\n       gap: 4px !important;\n     }\n   </style>\n </head>\n <body>\n<div class=\"description-meta-container\">\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/f463046e-0ed5-43b3-981c-944985082135.png\" />\n<div class=\"text-container\"><span class=\"sub-text\">Course Duration: </span> <span class=\"main-text\">21 September 2026 - 15 January 2027</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/972706bc-b79b-41e5-99b4-230290bd296c.png\" />\n<div class=\"text-container\"><span class=\"sub-text\"> Validity: </span> <span class=\"main-text\">31 March 2027</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/288f8906-de7a-44c8-8dd9-e9b4dfa15ea7.png\" /> Exam guidance at our PW Offline centers<span class=\"text\"><br /></span></div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/288f8906-de7a-44c8-8dd9-e9b4dfa15ea7.png\" /> One-to-one emotional well-being support by PW Prerna counselors<span class=\"text\"><br /></span></div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/288f8906-de7a-44c8-8dd9-e9b4dfa15ea7.png\" /> In-person support and helpdesk at PW Offline centers<span class=\"text\"><br /></span></div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/a5affa35-0c73-4ca1-8600-65d7ca8a328b.png\" />\n<div class=\"text-container\"><span class=\"sub-text\"> Subjects:</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","subjects":[]}}